  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">O Mundo Que Queremos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Karib mosaic, a 7-million-hectare area of multiple reserves, faces severe deforestation and invasions. Regnskogsf&#xf6;reningen&#x2019;s partner, O Mundo Que Queremos, protects the area and promotes sustainable development. The Radar Verde project monitors the Brazilian beef supply chain, ranking meatpackers, retailers, and financiers on zero-deforestation compliance. Through surveys, financial reporting, and advocacy, it drives measurable, independently audited action, aiming to fully decouple beef production from deforestation in the Amazon and Cerrado by 2028.</narrative>
  </description>
